{"site":"douban","sid":"1293399","imdb_id":"tt0086879","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0086879/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/1293399/","chinese_title":"莫扎特传","foreign_title":"Amadeus","year":"1984","aka":["上帝的宠儿","莫札特传","阿玛多伊斯","阿玛迪斯(台)"],"region":["美国","法国"],"genre":["剧情","音乐","传记"],"language":["英语","意大利语","拉丁语","德语","法语"],"playdate":["1984-09-19(美国)"],"episodes":"","duration":"160分钟","description":"本片从一个宫廷乐师萨里埃利的角度，为我们呈现了天才莫扎特的一生。萨里埃利（F·莫里·亚伯拉罕 F. Murray Abraham饰）是维也纳音乐界里有名的人物，自视甚高的他自从遇到了莫扎特（汤姆·休斯克 Tom Hulce饰），心里的妒嫉之火便熊熊燃烧不能平息。莫扎特总能以他超乎常人的音乐作品赢得全场惊叹，他的《费加罗的婚礼》等歌剧，都成了传颂千古的经典。\n萨里埃利对莫扎特又羡慕又嫉恨的心理已经发展到几乎扭曲的地步。他在莫扎特的事业上一次次的从中作梗——故意缩短歌剧的上演周期，恶意删改莫扎特的作品，在莫扎特承受着丧父之痛时给他无情的精神折磨。贫穷虚弱的莫扎特在生命最后的几年里，写就遗作《安魂曲》，一代大师35岁就与世长辞，留下不朽作品。而萨里埃利，早有等待他的宿命般的结局。","poster":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p595764767.jpg","douban_votes":"105619","douban_rating":"8.7","imdb_rating_average":"8.4","imdb_votes":"473640","imdb_rating":"8.4 / 10 from 473,640 users","director":[{"name":"米洛斯·福尔曼 Miloš Forman","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27259329/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p37577.webp"},{"name":"迈克尔·豪斯曼 Michael Hausman","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27514512/","role":"","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/f/vendors/8dd0c794499fe925ae2ae89ee30cd225750457b4/pics/personage-default-medium.png"}],"writer":[{"name":"彼得·谢弗 Peter Shaffer","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27251196/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p26427.webp"},{"name":"兹德内克·马勒 Zdenek Mahler","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27244502/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img9.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1599802039.96.webp"}],"cast":[{"name":"F·默里·亚伯拉罕 F. Murray Abraham","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27260806/","role":"饰 Antonio Salieri","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/6b76098ebaa80024b6f59836839dbd1